-- Test Description
-- Same as ptpv2_ipv4_real but in 64 bit DMA bus mode
-- See if PTP version2 frames in IPv4 can be detected
-- Real frames from PTPv2.pcap delivered by Hans Weibel (ZHAW)
--
-- Receive frames:-
-- RX Frame 1 : PTP sync frame
-- RX Frame 2 : PTP follow_up frame
-- RX Frame 3 : PTP delay request frame
-- RX Frame 4 : PTP delay response frame
--
-- Transmit frames:-
-- TX Frame 1 : PTP sync frame
-- TX Frame 2 : PTP follow_up frame
-- TX Frame 3 : PTP delay request frame
